Warning [L0529] (state_loop_unchanged): State-loop condition reads a mutable header binding without a body write before another turn
  --> tests/ui/state_loop_unchanged.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     loop i := 0, i < 3 {
    |          ^
 Why: The condition reads the state loop's header binding, but its body never changes that binding before control can return to the condition
 Fix: Use `loop line in io.stdin().lines()` for repeated reads, or stop from the body with `if test { break }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0529
